         <title>AstroDiffraction V1.0 (Windows x64)</title>
         <description>
            <p>Native PCL C++ Process for generating diffraction spikes. Requires PixInsight 1.9.5 on Windows x64.</p>
            <p>Installed under Process &gt; Convolution &gt; AstroDiffraction.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
